usage: source-reader.py [-h] [--roots JSON] {catalog,show,guide,browse} ...

Lazy read-only source browser. Found on disk; runtime visibility/activation
unknown.

positional arguments:
  {catalog,show,guide,browse}
    catalog             metadata only; no source bodies
    show                exact selected file bytes
    guide               GUIDE.md or immediate res chapter
    browse              terminal selection; nonTTY lists metadata

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --roots JSON          declared bounded roots override

No install, model, network, index or source execution. --roots may precede or
follow the command.
